# Doom main / demo loop, ported from d_main.c to Flow.
#
# Public ABI (d_main.h / doomgeneric.h / doom.h): D_ProcessEvents,
# D_PageTicker, D_PageDrawer, D_AdvanceDemo, D_DoAdvanceDemo, D_StartTitle,
# D_DoomMain, doomgeneric_Tick. Also D_Display / D_BindVariables /
# D_GrabMouseCallback / D_IdentifyVersion / D_SetGameDescription /
# D_DoomLoop (internal in C but exported for fidelity).
#
# Doomstat start flags / savegamedir / wipegamestate live here as `let mut`
# + @flow_api (was dmain_data.c). Private D_Main / demo-loop state and
# helpers live here too. FEATURE_DEHACKED / MULTIPLAYER / WAD_MERGE /
# ORIGCODE off — DEH_String identity; GetGameName / PrintDehackedBanners /
# BFG DEH_AddStringReplacement are no-ops.
#
# Helpers prefixed dmain_*. Consts use DMAIN_. Reserved: handle, type.

